	<section_number>46.2-823</section_number>
	<catch_line>Unlawful speed forfeits right-of-way</catch_line>
	<text>
		The driver of any vehicle traveling at an unlawful speed shall forfeit any right-of-way which he might otherwise have under this article.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 46-238; 1952, c. 666; 1956, c. 533; 1958, c. 541, § 46.1-221; 1985, c. 218; 1989, c. 727.</history>
